** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-monitor.wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈmɑ.nɪ.tɚ/|[ˈmɑ.nɪ.ɾɚ]|/ˈmɑ.nə.tɚ/|[ˈmɑ.nə.ɾɚ]|a=cot-caught,GA,Atlantic Canada}}
