bulletin board.content:
==English==
[[File:Infinite-corridor-bboard.jpeg|thumb]]
{{wp}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|bulletin|board}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Flame, not lame-bulletin board.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[board]] on which [[message]]s may be [[posted]], especially one in a [[public]] space.
#: {{syn|en|notice board<q:UK>|pinboard}}
#* {{RQ:Pynchon Crying of Lot 49|year=1976|page=90|passage=Somewhere near Fillmore she found the symbol tacked to the '''bulletin board''' of a laundromat, among other scraps of paper offering cheap ironing and baby sitters.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=2019|author=Li Huang; James Lambert|title=Another Arrow for the Quiver: A New Methodology for Multilingual Researchers|journal=Journal of Multilingual and Multicultural Development|doi=10.1080/01434632.2019.1596115|page=5|text=It should come as no surprise to see promotional material and '''bulletin boards''' in the department’s languages, though English is also present in the signage of this microcosm of the institution.}}
# {{lb|en|computing}} {{ellipsis of|en|bulletin board system}}.
