==English==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|some|where}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsʌm.wɛɹ/|/ˈsʌm.ʍɛɹ/|a=GA}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsʌm.wɛː/|/ˈsʌm.wɛə/|/ˈsʌm.ʍɛə/|a=RP}}
