#* {{RQ:Dryden Juvenal Satires|8|passage=His courteous host {{...}} / '''Tags''' every sentence with some fawning word.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[fasten]]; to [[attach]].
#* '''a. 1751''', {{w|Henry St John, 1st Viscount Bolingbroke}}, ''an essay''
#*: they began to '''tag''' their law with the scraps of philofophy
# {{rfquote-sense|en}} {{lb|en|transitive|MMO|slang}} To make [[contact]] with an [[enemy]], usually by [[attack|attacking]] it before other [[player]]s do, to [[establish]] [[exclusive]] or [[partial]] [[eligibility]] for [[loot]], [[experience points]] [[achievement]]s, etc.
