#* {{quote-book|en|title=Secular Review: A Journal of Agnosticism|volume=16–17|page=253|year=1885|url=https://www.google.co.uk/books/edition/Secular_Review/mbxCAAAAYAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=%22a+think%22&pg=PA253&printsec=frontcover|text=The question is briefly this: Is the Ego only a '''''think'''''? If so, whence comes the '''''think'''''?}}

