* Esperanto: {{t+|eo|ŝajni}}
* Finnish: {{tt+|fi|vaikuttaa}}
* Galician: {{tt+|gl|coidar}}
* Portuguese: {{tt+|pt|parecer}}
}}
{{trans-bottom}}

