===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:contre<ref:{{R:Etymonline|pos=n}}<<name::0>>>|tree=1|text=++}} Cognate with {{cog|sco|kintra}}. Unrelated to {{m|en|county}}. Displaced native {{m+|en|land}} in some of its senses.

From around 1300 as "area surrounding a walled city or town; the open country." By early 16th century the sense was applied mostly to rural areas, as opposed to towns and cities.<ref name=":0"/>

Compare typologically {{m+|ru|страна́}}, {{m|ru|сторона́}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|kŭn'tri}}
** {{IPA|en|/ˈkʌntɹi/|[ˈkʰʌnt̠ɹ̠̊˔ʷi]|a=RP,US,CA}}
