#* {{RQ:Noire Thug-A-Licious|page=103|passage=I wasn't performing with Pimp and Smoove that much no more, but I had a solo deal with Ruthless Rap and a brand new mixtape that was creating a big '''buzz'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Time|date=Sept 6 2006|author=Daren Fonda|url=http://www.time.com/time/business/article/0,8599,1532256,00.html|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20120916205328/http://www.time.com/time/business/article/0,8599,1532256,00.html|archivedate=16 September 2012|title=Ford Motor's New Chief: "I Think It's a Tough Situation"
|passage=In Detroit, the '''buzz''' is that he's too nice a guy, unwilling to impose draconian job cuts at the risk of angering the UAW.}}
