kill.content:
{{also|Kill|kíll}}
==English==
{{wp}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɪl/|[ˈkʰɪɫ]|a=RP,US,CA}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-kill.ogg|a=US}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-kill.wav|a=Southern England}}
*** {{IPA|en|[ˈkʰɪʊ̯]|[ˈkɪɤ̯]|a=l-vocalization}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪl|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|id=to put to death}}
From {{inh|en|enm|killen}}, {{m|enm|kyllen}}, {{m|enm|cullen|cüllen|t=to strike, beat, cut}}, of obscure origin. Cognate with {{cog|sco|kele}}, {{m|sco||keil|t=to kill}}.
* Perhaps from unattested {{inh|en|ang|*cyllan}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*kwulljan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*kwuljaną}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*gʷelH-|t=to throw, hit, hurt by throwing}}.
* Or, possibly a variant of {{inh|en|ang|cwellan|t=to kill, murder, execute}} (see {{l|en|quell}}).
* Or, from {{der|en|non|kolla|t=to hit on the head, harm}}, related to {{cog|no|kylla|t=to poll}}, {{cog|dum|kollen|t=to knock down}}, {{cog|is|kollur|t=top, head}}; see also {{l|en|coll}}, {{l|en|cole}}).

Compare also {{cog|stq|källe|t=to hurt}}, {{cog|dum|kellen|t=to kill, hurt}}, {{cog|gml|kellen}}, {{m|gml|killen|t=to ache strongly, cause one great pain}} (whence {{cog|nds-de|kellen}}, {{m|nds-de|killen|t=to hurt, injure, torment, vex}}), {{cog|gmh|kellen|t=to torment; torture}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|en|k1ll||filter-avoidance spelling}}

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To put to [[death]]; to [[extinguish]] the [[life]] of.
#: {{ux|en|Smoking '''kills''' more people each year than alcohol and hard drugs combined.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare King Lear|act=IV|scene=vi|page=304|passage=A Troope of Horſe with Felt: Ile put't in proofe, / And when I haue ſtolne vpon theſe Son in Lawes, / Then '''kill''', '''kill''', '''kill''', '''kill''', '''kill''', '''kill'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Tempest|III|ii|page=12|passage={{smallcaps|Stephano}}: {{w|Caliban|Monſter}}, I will '''kill''' this man : his daughter and I will be King and Queene, ſave our Graces : and ''Trinculo'' and thy ſelfe ſhall be Vice-royes : {{...}}}}
