#* {{quote-book|en|year=1993|title=The Journal of Jewish Thought & Philosophy|page=154
|passage=These were pamphlets, often written in various Jewish vernaculars, describing the location of the Holy sites and '''salting''' the accounts with mythic and homiletical materials.}}
# {{lb|en|cryptography}} To add filler bytes before encrypting, in order to make [[brute-force]] [[decryption]] more resource-intensive.
# To render a thing [[useless]].
