|text=Despite the fact that ice '''blocks''' its harbors in heavy winters, the Baltic has become one of the world's most active seas.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2020 January 2|author=Philip Haigh|title=Is there relief to congestion along Castlefield Corridor?|journal=Rail|page=23|text=However, at [[Manchester]] the junctions and signals are so close that a train running more slowly over several junctions simply '''blocks''' those junctions for longer, preventing other trains moving.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To prevent (something or someone) from passing.
#: {{ux|en|A broken-down car is '''blocking''' the traffic.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To prevent (something from happening or someone from doing something).
#: {{ux|en|His plan to take over the business was '''blocked''' by the boss.}}
