|text=Mr. Ip, who was the chairman of the Yau Tsim Mong district council, became a target of protesters in July after he '''blocked''' debate on the extradition bill that incited the protests this summer.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|sports}} To impede (an opponent or opponent’s play).
#: {{ux|en|He '''blocked''' the basketball player’s shot.}}
#: {{ux|en|The offensive linemen tried to '''block''' the blitz.}}
