# {{lb|en|transitive|cricket}} To hit with a block.
# {{lb|en|intransitive|cricket}} To play a block shot.
# {{sid|en|Q2125156, v}} {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[bar]] (impose a [[ban]] on a person or [[bot]], etc.) from connecting via [[telephone]], [[instant messaging]], etc., or from accessing an online account or service, or similar.
#: {{syn|en|nuclear block<q:Bluesky><id:Q2125156, v>}}
