|text=Then I finished knitting the socks and wove in all ends for each sock before soaking them in warm water and wool wash for 20 minutes and '''blocking''' them on sock blockers.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To shape or sketch out roughly.
#: {{ux|en|When drawing a scene, first '''block''' the main features, and then fill in the detail.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To experience [[mental block]] or [[creative block]].
