#* {{quote-book|en |author={{w|Dorothy M. Johnson}}|year=1950|newversion=in |type2=book |editor2=|title={{w|A Man Called Horse (short story)|A Man Called Horse}}|title2=Indian Country|location2=London |publisher2=Corgi|year2=1961 |page2=177|text=The dog always moved, with a '''yelp''', but it always got in the way again.}}
